 erit a distinct predecessor's rankings. M is an editorial estimate.\nScop
 e: Biometrics and identity science across face\, fingerprint\, iris\, voi
 ce\, gait\, and behavioral modalities. Defining concerns include recognit
 ion and verification\, multimodal fusion\, presentation-attack and deepfa
 ke detection\, biometric template security\, privacy\, demographic fairne
 ss\, and rigorous benchmarking. Learned representations and foundation mo
